<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    1213    707    2517    44</p>
<p> Great Lakes    26041   9648   14904    30</p>
<p> River Points   14838  25494   26274    38</p>
<p> Southwest	11946   9022     596    18</p>
<p> Gulf Points    12735   6274    7383    32</p>
<p> Plains Area    33084  28804    3613    39</p>
<p> Pacific NW     11451   1224     unq    43</p>
<p> Grand Total   111308  81173   55287    33</p>
